"releaseNotes":"We’ve updated the beginning of the game, fixed bugs, and improved performance.\n\n• Updated the prologue — the tutorial is now shorter and clearer, with unnecessary scenes removed and new hints added.\n• Optimized animations and loading, making menus open faster and levels load more quickly.\n• Fixed issues with health and armor upgrades, store transitions, weapon sounds, achievement animations, and notifications.\n• Improved texts and translations.\n\nThank you for playing Pixel Combat! Leave a review — we read every one.", "price":0.00, "genres":["Games", "Casual", "Action"], "artistId":1091563899, "artistName":"PSV Studio", "releaseDate":"2017-09-16T04:07:08Z", "trackId":1266181959, "trackName":"Pixel Combat: Zombies Strike", "primaryGenreName":"Games", "primaryGenreId":6014, "genreIds":["6014", "7003", "7001"], "sellerName":"PSV STUDIO LTD", "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled":true, "currentVersionReleaseDate":"2026-09-25T16:52:03Z", "version":"5.5.6", "wrapperType":"software", "currency":"USD", 
"description":"Defend your house from hordes of zombies. Survive, build a time machine, and save humanity. Pixel Combat: Zombies Strike is a pixel first-person zombie shooter with wave battles, shelter defense, and base survival.\n\nFight through wave after wave, board up the house, place barricades, defend your shelter, and search for resources. Aim fast, move smart, and use the right weapon in every fight. If you like zombie games, action shooters, FPS combat, and survival under siege, get ready for nonstop attacks, dangerous enemies, and intense boss fights.\n\nExplore 40+ 3D locations, complete 110+ missions, and find 120+ secrets and hidden rooms. Every level pushes you to fight harder and play smarter. Enemies grow stronger, bosses use special abilities, and you must change position, manage resources, and hold your base.\n\nUse 60+ weapons to stop the undead horde. Fight with knives, axes, pistols, rifles, shotguns, machine guns, a flamethrower, a minigun, and more. Craft weapons and ammo, strengthen your defenses, and prepare for the next attack.\n\nSecret rooms, rare resources, and rewards help you survive longer and move closer to your goal. Step by step, collect what you need to build a time machine and save the world.\n\nGame Features:\n\n- Pixel first-person zombie shooter with 110+ missions full of action, survival, and intense combat\n- House defense and shelter survival against undead waves\n- Barricades, base defense, and survival tactics across 40+ 3D battle locations\n- 120+ secrets and hidden rooms for players who explore every level\n- Boss fights and monsters with special abilities that make every battle more dangerous\n- Craft weapons and ammo, use 60+ weapons, and unlock 150+ weapon skins\n- Black Ops-inspired zombie action in a pixel world\n- Minecraft-style characters and blocky skins, plus 20+ skins for your character\n- A time machine story about saving humanity and 80+ achievements to complete\n\nInstall Pixel Combat: Zombies Strike, shoot zombies, survive the waves, defend your shelter, complete missions, collect weapons, hold your base, and save humanity in this zombie FPS shooter.\n\nThe app offers an auto-renewing subscription, “VIP Gold Status,” which gives players extra rewards without ads. Subscription duration: 1 week.\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://avegagames.com/legal/pixel-combat-privacy-policy.html\nTerms & Conditions: https://avegagames.com/legal/pixel-combat-terms-conditions.html", "bundleId":"com.gsgames.pixel.combat", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.8109400000000004382627594168297946453094482421875, "userRatingCount":13731}, 
