"description":"That zombie apocalypse you’ve always wanted to bring about is finally a thing!\n\nGraft and stitch together different mutant zombies and create an undead horde to call yours! \n\nEach and every one of them will be a unique shambling corpse with hopes and dreams and a healthy appetite for human brains!\n\nAnd they’re very low-maintenance, too, what with their favorite dish being so abundant and all.\n\nIt’s every necromancer’s dream!\n\nUNDEAD FEATURES\n\n• Pantheon: a new place for supreme beings to look down on us mortals and laugh at our misery\n• Impostors: watch out for impostors trying to steal the spotlight from the zombies\n\nHOW TO PLAY\n• Drag and drop similar zombies to create new mysterious creatures\n• Use zombie eggs to earn coins, buy new creatures and make even more money\n• Alternatively, fiercely tap a zombie to make coins pop from their eggs\n\nHIGHLIGHTS\n• Different stages and many zombie species to discover\n• A mind-blowing story with brain melting twists!\n• The unexpected mix of alpaca-like evolution and incremental clicker games\n• Doodle-like illustrations\n• Various possible endings: find your destiny\n• No zombies were harmed in the making of this game, only developers\n\nNow THIS is bio hazard!\n\nDisclaimer: While this App is completely free to play, some additional content can be purchased for real money in-game. If you do not want to use this feature, please turn off in-app purchases in your device's settings.\n\nLike our page on Facebook and be the first to know about our upcoming games and updates! http://fb.com/tappshq", "bundleId":"br.com.tapps.zombieevolution", "averageUserRatingForCurrentVersion":4.720150000000000289901436190120875835418701171875, "userRatingCount":2119}]
